- For all `i` in `[0, index)`, `this.get(i)` after the operation equals `\old(this.get(i))`.

Note: Since the method throws `IndexOutOfBoundsException` on invalid index (via `rangeCheckForAdd`), we only need to consider the case when the index is valid.

Thus, the correct assert statement is:

<code>assert \forall int i; 0 <= i && i < index; this.get(i).equals(\old(this.get(i)));</code>
